          "block_label": "figure_title",
          "block_content": "Fig. 14. Line drawing of the N–S seismic profile T1. The profile is located west of the Elba–Pianosa ridge in the Corsica Basin (see Figs 4D and 13 for positions). Note: (i) continuous presence of Oligocene strata below the Neogene; (ii) regular pattern of Tir 0. (The uninterpreted seismic profile has been published in Lazzarotto et al. (1995); A, B, C, D are unconformities also shown in Fig. 7.)",
