        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(sp. 900–1000; Fig. 19), traces of gently prograding clinoforms can be observed and, in places (T7, sp. 500; Fig. 19), mounded reflections have been recognized. The maximum thickness of Tir 2 is 0.6 s TWT.",
